# DRC-ARR-2: A 3x3 array of an m1c cell at pitch 15 (elements overlap by 5) with exact_overlap m1c (why 1).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/drctest -noprompt
snap internal
drc off
load child
box 0 0 20 20
paint m1c
load top
box 0 0 0 0
getcell child
select cell child_0
box 0 0 15 15
array 3 3
select top cell
box grow center 100
drc check
drc catchup
drc listall why
drc list count total
writeall force
